<title>USA: Travelers/Aetna sets $150 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Travelers/Aetna sets $150 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Travelers/Aetna Property Casualty Corp was priced on Tuesday, said lead manager Smith Barney.</p>
<p>BORROWER TRAVELERS/AETNA PROPERTY CASUALTY CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.827  FIRST PAY DATE 05/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 6.774	 PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 55 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
